%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: EastofWhiterun
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393415
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, Sayori?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you sure they're going to let us into the college, we haven't finished
      high school yet...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393416
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm pretty sure we've got a better education than the vast majority of
      the people of Tamriel.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393417
    - rid: 9079475230094393418
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Different cosmology and physics system not withstanding, of course.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393419
    - rid: 9079475230094393420
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393423
    - rid: 9079475230094393424
    - rid: 9079475230094393425
    - rid: 9079475230094393426
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, is there some sort of tuition that we''ll need to pay?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393427
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Nope.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'In fact, you get a better deal than most college students these days:
      a free room, too.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393428
    - rid: 9079475230094393429
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393430
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Do we, like, gotta do homework and stuff?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393431
    - rid: 9079475230094393432
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If your experience at all mirrors the player's?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Absolutely not.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393433
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Although, I would argue that it'd probably be for the best if you did
      your own reading and research.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393434
    - rid: 9079475230094393435
    - rid: 9079475230094393436
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You know, considering you'll have access to one of the few libraries
      that exist in Skyrim.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393437
    - rid: 9079475230094393438
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Which I'm pretty sure is the biggest one in the province.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, Sayori, I'm not sure if the literature club's vice president should
      be crying at the thought of reading a book...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393439
    - rid: 9079475230094393442
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393443
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I just thought maybe I'd able to enjoy not worrying about school while
      we're here...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: But you're making me read, {mc}!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475230094393444
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
